source-almost everywhere.  This is the pointwise input for uniqueness of plans. -/
theorem uniform_ae_eq_supporting_map_of_fenchel_eq
    {d : ℕ} {K Y : Set (E d)} {u v : E d → ℝ} {T : E d → E d} {L : ℝ≥0}
